The real-time departures and the traffic messages come from the official
real-time API of Wiener Linien, https://www.wienerlinien.at/ogd_realtime
(documentation: https://www.wienerlinien.at/ogd_realtime/doku/), and the names
and numbers of the stops and lines from the open data files published next to
it (wienerlinien-ogd-haltestellen.csv, -haltepunkte.csv, -linien.csv). They are
open government data of the City of Vienna under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Data source: City of Vienna - https://data.wien.gv.at (Datenquelle: Stadt Wien
- data.wien.gv.at). The widgets show the source and the time of each reading.

The files under test/fixtures/ogd are extracts of those open data files
(CC BY 4.0). The answers of the API used by the tests were built with the
fields and formats recorded from the real API on 2026-11-12.

